R. S. Conway, The pre-Hellenic inscriptions of Praesos, Annual of the British
School at Athens 8 (1901–1902), pp. 125–156, especially pp. 127 and 135.
https://archive.org/details/annual-of-the-british-school-at-athens_1901-1902_8
