The historical publications are public-domain originals; their digitized
page evidence is a mechanical reproduction. Project images were rendered
from the linked scans to JPEG; full source PDF hashes are retained in each
reading. No modern publisher's edited critical text was imported.

The original publications precede 1931. Conway died in 1933, Bosanquet in
1935 and Dawkins in 1955. Documentary biographical sources:
